WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.752
Hey everybody, it’s Aldis.

00:00:01.752 --> 00:00:04.546
As an actor, host and advocate, 

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:07.716
I’m blessed with the opportunity
to help tell amazing stories.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:11.220
And on December 3rd, I’ll be
hosting a celebration of five new

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:14.348
incredible storytellers and their
award-winning screenplays.

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:17.309
The Academy Nicholl Fellowships
in Screenwriting has discovered

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:21.647
storytellers and championed
inclusive storytelling for 35 years.

00:00:21.647 --> 00:00:25.108
On December 3rd, I’ll be joined
by fellow actors and leaders

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:28.195
in the motion picture industry
in a ceremony for the Nicholl’s

00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:31.198
five new fellows for 2020.

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:33.784
With everything going on in
the world, their fierce and 

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:37.621
unique stories are more timely,
more urgent than ever.

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:39.581
And that’s true for you as well. 

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:42.501
Today, your story can be
more impactful than ever.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:46.630
Your story can entertain
or educate or empower.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.716
Your story can do all that.
And more.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:52.886
Your story can change
the world.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.554
Your story is everything.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:58.308
So, tune in on December 3rd
to get involved and get inspired.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:00.811
To learn more about the
Nicholl Fellowships story visit -

00:01:00.811 --> 00:01:03.146
NichollFellowships.org

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:06.858
And, most importantly of all,
we can’t wait to hear yours.

